{# The Markdown export of a transcript (ThreadExporter): for each message of
   `messages`, a level 2 heading with `message.heading`, a blank line, and the
   Markdown of its content (message-markdown.stencil). A blank line separates
   two sections, and a document with a section ends with a line break. The
   headings are catalog text of the model, so the template has no word of
   its own. #}
{%- for message in messages %}{% if not forloop.first %}
{% endif %}## {{ message.heading }}

{% include "message-markdown.stencil" %}
{% endfor -%}
